{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle Weapon Girl is a stage-clearing action game in which you have to knock down a large number of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run up a building in a futuristic city or jump down to the lowest level, every place becomes a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/foll.gif?t=1742856417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist is a mercenary for hire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the city where he has arrived, he has long held off an invasion by invaders, but the war is going badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He hires mercenaries and deploys them to fill the overwhelming gap in strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every part of the city is under attack and in danger of falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you join the war, the story begins to take off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go to the battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive requests from city operators and wipe out the enemy in the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purchase weapons with collected parts and power up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect parts found on the stage and bring them to the store to exchange them for weapons.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591470?t=1742856417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3591470?t=1742856417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/c5cc8fcfae9332294e04cd0368ed00227028b865/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742856417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/c5cc8fcfae9332294e04cd0368ed00227028b865/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742856417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Struggle Weapon Girl is a stage-clearing action game in which you have to knock down a large number of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run up a building in a futuristic city or jump down to the lowest level, every place becomes a battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/extras/foll.gif?t=1742856417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist is a mercenary for hire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the city where he has arrived, he has long held off an invasion by invaders, but the war is going badly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">He hires mercenaries and deploys them to fill the overwhelming gap in strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every part of the city is under attack and in danger of falling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you join the war, the story begins to take off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Go to the battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Receive requests from city operators and wipe out the enemy in the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Purchase weapons with collected parts and power up</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect parts found on the stage and bring them to the store to exchange them for weapons.</p>","developers":["Sedy"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3591470/274b6b2936275f41d4f61dec09434b32ae1e49c4/header.jpg?t=1742856417","is_free":false,"linux_require